WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
In today's Cloud Minute I'm going to show you how to sign up for a free trial

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.666
and create your first project.

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:06.566
To start to navigate to

00:00:06.566 --> 00:00:08.700
cloud.google.com and click free trial.

00:00:09.366 --> 00:00:10.033
If you aren't already

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:12.166
signed in to your Google Account you'll sign in now.

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:16.233
Fill in your personal information. This form may look a little different

00:00:16.233 --> 00:00:17.733
if you are outside the US.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.166
Now fill in your credit card information.

00:00:22.166 --> 00:00:25.166
Your card will not be charged unless you upgrade to a paid account.

00:00:25.166 --> 00:00:28.166
We only collect your credit card information to verify your identity 

00:00:28.166 --> 00:00:29.900
and to ensure you aren't a robot. 

00:00:30.766 --> 00:00:31.366
Click to accept

00:00:31.366 --> 00:00:34.133
the terms and condition and then click accept and start free trial.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.400
It may take a minute or two for your account

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.133
and your first project to be created.

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:40.533
After account creation

00:00:40.533 --> 00:00:43.533
you'll be redirected to the project dashboard.  From here

00:00:43.533 --> 00:00:47.033
you can either follow one of the tutorials or you can start working on your own application.

00:00:48.833 --> 00:00:50.766
I hope this helps you get started.

